  "description": "Answers whether the exact request (fixture, source and optional calendar) would run, by executing it. runnable is true exactly when the matching run envelope is a success. Each listed gap says whether the calendar declares it exactly; undeclaredGapCount is complete even when the list is truncated, and undeclared gaps are listed first.",
